    "verdict": "DOES_NOT_SUPPORT_HYPOTHESIS",
    "summary": "On all three signal dates, at the longest matured horizon, the frozen score-1.0.0 pool underperformed the equal-weight pool drawn from the same universe on the same date. The edge over doing nothing is negative on every date (-8.435%, -4.769%, -2.786%).",
